'''Dulin''' is an [[NPC]] found initially in the {{zone|Hanging Court}}, and later in the {{Zone|Dwarven Base Camp}}. He unlocks the {{Item|Secret Railroad Pass}} [[Forge]] recipe and grants access to the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}, and only appears upon reaching {{Coll|Heart of the Mountain 7}}.

