== Trivia ==
*'''Dulin''' states that he is a descendant of [[Divan]], who is a currently unseen [[NPC]] to whom the discovery of the {{Item|Divan Fragment}} and {{Item|Divan's Alloy}} is attributed.
**'''Dulin''' also states that he is the rightful king, meaning [[Divan]] used to be king.
*'''Dulin''' could be based on the character of [https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/Durin_I Durin] from the Lord of the Rings.

